<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan stock market closes for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan stock market closes for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's stock market was closed on Thursday for a public holiday. It will reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the weighted index closed sharply lower, losing 106.78 points, or 1.24 percent, at 8,485.66. Turnover was an active T$116 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
